Manages inference-server lifecycle and model profiles across the GPUs and
slots described in the rig config (~/.config/model-swap/config.yaml, see
config.example.yaml). Profiles live in <models_dir>/profiles/*.yaml.

Writes the GPU contract (default ~/gpu-contract.yaml) on every state change —
the single source of truth for all GPU consumers (harnesses, pipelines, scripts).
"""

